  characterName: Chico Santos
  promptText: Commercial loggers are removing rare medicinal trees. Covert documentation
    could create evidence for protection campaigns but would likely mark your family
    as targets. The decision weighs knowledge preservation and accountability against
    immediate personal risk.
  leftAnswer: Documenting the damage can preserve irreplaceable knowledge and build
    a case for protection.
  rightAnswer: Keeping quiet shields your loved ones now and lets you gather strength.
